{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Swim. Grow. Try again.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960270/extras/54db3a627d48a79af643ee81fac46327.poster.avif?t=1756463898\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960270/extras/54db3a627d48a79af643ee81fac46327.webm?t=1756463898\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960270/extras/54db3a627d48a79af643ee81fac46327.mp4?t=1756463898\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Siegeturtle is a cozy idle RPG roguelite about a turtle swimming home through hostile seas. Your turtle moves on its own while companions support you. You upgrade attributes, skills, equipment and push a little further each run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A jetpack? A cannon? Why not both? Blast through different biomes with quirky upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960270/extras/713e0e1b7a055b34b5838d5594021c72.poster.avif?t=1756463898\" width=546 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960270/extras/713e0e1b7a055b34b5838d5594021c72.webm?t=1756463898\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960270/extras/713e0e1b7a055b34b5838d5594021c72.mp4?t=1756463898\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unlock Companions!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit dolphins, unicorns, seals - each granting a unique ability to your party.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960270/extras/da3f373806d4c9235262a89e9f076620.poster.avif?t=1756463898\" width=398 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960270/extras/da3f373806d4c9235262a89e9f076620.webm?t=1756463898\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960270/extras/da3f373806d4c9235262a89e9f076620.mp4?t=1756463898\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Level up your favorite attributes!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strength, Agility, Intelligence, or Vitality? Each makes your turtle stronger in different ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960270/extras/9cb53f7681a2463531c8fac71356e16a.poster.avif?t=1756463898\" width=780 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960270/extras/9cb53f7681a2463531c8fac71356e16a.webm?t=1756463898\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960270/extras/9cb53f7681a2463531c8fac71356e16a.mp4?t=1756463898\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Pick skills to fit your playstyle!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you grow, spend skill points to upgrade your turtle and companions' abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960270/extras/3e615810067ecace7dea404b241cd83c.poster.avif?t=1756463898\" width=780 height=146 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960270/extras/3e615810067ecace7dea404b241cd83c.webm?t=1756463898\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960270/extras/3e615810067ecace7dea404b241cd83c.mp4?t=1756463898\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hunt for Legendary Equipment!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Summon bosses to earn new gear. Choose synergies that complement your build - boost gold gain, regen, drop rates, crits and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Break down unwanted gear into upgrade materials, raising your summoning level for a better shot at legendary drops!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960270/extras/759a49b6a96a500e73e24d4dea92d3fb.poster.avif?t=1756463898\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960270/extras/759a49b6a96a500e73e24d4dea92d3fb.webm?t=1756463898\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960270/extras/759a49b6a96a500e73e24d4dea92d3fb.mp4?t=1756463898\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fish for Power</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Send your turtle to fish. Sell fish for gold, or hold them for passive stat bonuses.\u00a0Upgrade your imaginary fishing rod to reel rarer fish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960270/extras/c4466795b640c7d6f7b800be815f0363.poster.avif?t=1756463898\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960270/extras/c4466795b640c7d6f7b800be815f0363.webm?t=1756463898\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960270/extras/c4466795b640c7d6f7b800be815f0363.mp4?t=1756463898\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Conquer Achievements</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Achievements aren't just for show - they grant permanent stats to your turtle and allies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960270/extras/588e7fe01d04e7450f8cc8e8db63fdcf.poster.avif?t=1756463898\" width=382 height=312 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960270/extras/588e7fe01d04e7450f8cc8e8db63fdcf.webm?t=1756463898\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960270/extras/588e7fe01d04e7450f8cc8e8db63fdcf.mp4?t=1756463898\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Ascend and Evolve </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the time is right, reset your journey in a surge of new power. Each ascension grants permanent upgrades to make your turtle faster and stronger than before!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960270/extras/78423e10fc0cd08e898620aede73b79f.poster.avif?t=1756463898\" width=780 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960270/extras/78423e10fc0cd08e898620aede73b79f.webm?t=1756463898\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960270/extras/78423e10fc0cd08e898620aede73b79f.mp4?t=1756463898\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Demo does not contain the following features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fishing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ascension</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Milestone rewards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Legendary and above equipment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Limited to maximum 8 companions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skills cannot increase beyond Level 30</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3960270?t=1756463898","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960270/7a304ec32de6105e2d2252959a22484529ea01d6/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756463898","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960270/b07283f883df98883d28e8ce9053b3b174502b99/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756463898","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960270/b07283f883df98883d28e8ce9053b3b174502b99/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756463898","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Swim. Grow. Try again.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960270/extras/54db3a627d48a79af643ee81fac46327.poster.avif?t=1756463898\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960270/extras/54db3a627d48a79af643ee81fac46327.webm?t=1756463898\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960270/extras/54db3a627d48a79af643ee81fac46327.mp4?t=1756463898\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Siegeturtle is a cozy idle RPG roguelite about a turtle swimming home through hostile seas. Your turtle moves on its own while companions support you. You upgrade attributes, skills, equipment and push a little further each run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A jetpack? A cannon? Why not both? Blast through different biomes with quirky upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960270/extras/713e0e1b7a055b34b5838d5594021c72.poster.avif?t=1756463898\" width=546 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960270/extras/713e0e1b7a055b34b5838d5594021c72.webm?t=1756463898\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960270/extras/713e0e1b7a055b34b5838d5594021c72.mp4?t=1756463898\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unlock Companions!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit dolphins, unicorns, seals - each granting a unique ability to your party.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960270/extras/da3f373806d4c9235262a89e9f076620.poster.avif?t=1756463898\" width=398 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960270/extras/da3f373806d4c9235262a89e9f076620.webm?t=1756463898\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960270/extras/da3f373806d4c9235262a89e9f076620.mp4?t=1756463898\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Level up your favorite attributes!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strength, Agility, Intelligence, or Vitality? Each makes your turtle stronger in different ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960270/extras/9cb53f7681a2463531c8fac71356e16a.poster.avif?t=1756463898\" width=780 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960270/extras/9cb53f7681a2463531c8fac71356e16a.webm?t=1756463898\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960270/extras/9cb53f7681a2463531c8fac71356e16a.mp4?t=1756463898\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Pick skills to fit your playstyle!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you grow, spend skill points to upgrade your turtle and companions' abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960270/extras/3e615810067ecace7dea404b241cd83c.poster.avif?t=1756463898\" width=780 height=146 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960270/extras/3e615810067ecace7dea404b241cd83c.webm?t=1756463898\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960270/extras/3e615810067ecace7dea404b241cd83c.mp4?t=1756463898\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hunt for Legendary Equipment!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Summon bosses to earn new gear. Choose synergies that complement your build - boost gold gain, regen, drop rates, crits and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Break down unwanted gear into upgrade materials, raising your summoning level for a better shot at legendary drops!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960270/extras/759a49b6a96a500e73e24d4dea92d3fb.poster.avif?t=1756463898\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960270/extras/759a49b6a96a500e73e24d4dea92d3fb.webm?t=1756463898\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960270/extras/759a49b6a96a500e73e24d4dea92d3fb.mp4?t=1756463898\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fish for Power</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Send your turtle to fish. Sell fish for gold, or hold them for passive stat bonuses.\u00a0Upgrade your imaginary fishing rod to reel rarer fish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960270/extras/c4466795b640c7d6f7b800be815f0363.poster.avif?t=1756463898\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960270/extras/c4466795b640c7d6f7b800be815f0363.webm?t=1756463898\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960270/extras/c4466795b640c7d6f7b800be815f0363.mp4?t=1756463898\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Conquer Achievements</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Achievements aren't just for show - they grant permanent stats to your turtle and allies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960270/extras/588e7fe01d04e7450f8cc8e8db63fdcf.poster.avif?t=1756463898\" width=382 height=312 ><source src=\"ht